00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:04.660
to protect Earth from the Vagan!

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:17.010
Asemu!

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:25.140
You better focus on our battle!

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:31.520
Damn it, don't interfere!{get in my way!}

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:45.160
<i>Asemu.</i>

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:48.450
I'm not fighting because I was born as a Vagan.

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:54.290
I have something I would sacrifice my life to accomplish.

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:55.790
<i>I'm not like you!</i>

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:59.340
Something you'd sacrifice your life to accomplish...?

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:00.220
And what's that?{yes, seriously}

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:03.050
You could never understand!

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:17.320
We did it, Commander.

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:22.070
The Fa Boze was destroyed?

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:24.660
<i>Zeheart! I mean, Commander!</i>

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:29.080
<i>The enemy's tactics have forced most of our forces to retreat.</i>

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:34.080
<i>I sent in our reserve forces, but we cannot continue the operation!</i>

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:40.590
Damn you, Flit!

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:45.010
This is war. I'll defeat you any way I can!

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:48.600
What? What's going on?!

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:50.060
<i>Desil, it's over.</i>

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:51.480
Why, Zeheart?!

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.480
<i>The operation is a failure!</i>

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:55.190
Let me go!

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:57.360
I can win this! Let me keep going!

00:20:57.360 --> 00:20:59.400
Zeheart!

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:04.320
We underestimated the strength of the Federation.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:06.990
Especially the power of Flit Asuno...

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.620
<i>This is Zeheart.</i>

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:10.870
<i>All forces, retreat!</i>

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:13.790
Roger.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:19.880
Asemu. The next time we meet, I'll kill you.

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:23.420
So that I can remain myself...

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:43.030
I'm... doing it for everyone.

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:45.490
Not for myself!

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:52.660
We survived...

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:54.540
Nice job.

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:57.000
C-Commander Asuno.

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:01.630
